tore_item_assets/steam/apps/3281090/extras/9e4baeaffeb7425c39f48418be7c2386.mp4?t=1745510485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare the food but be careful not to burn it!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281090/extras/09654a35c892990ff46678847c1c7a90.avif?t=1745510485\" width=800 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281090/extras/00366071313010180e0dbaeda570ff55.poster.avif?t=1745510485\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281090/extras/00366071313010180e0dbaeda570ff55.webm?t=1745510485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281090/extras/00366071313010180e0dbaeda570ff55.mp4?t=1745510485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers and collect your profit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the relaxing Dark Fantasy style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stock and buy new bags of food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your restaurant and make it just the way you want it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your appliances to make them faster, prettier and more efficient</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire monster cats to help you</p></li></ul>",
